# fixedbugs, defect 143, panel 185 R1, lane ffi-macro, 2026-10-02.
#
# SYMPTOM: `constant SQUARE: i64`, a function-like macro read as a value, was
# `ffi_unknown_name`, *declares no `SQUARE`*: unexpanded without its
# parentheses, the name is undeclared to clang.
#
# FIX: told as a macro that takes arguments, which has no value until it is
# called, with the same repair.

extern "fixedbugs-143-macros.h"
    constant SQUARE: i64  #~ ffi_macro_name

function main()
    print(SQUARE)
